      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਬਿਜਲੀ ਵਾਗ) ਲਿਸ਼ਕਾਉਾਂਦੇ ਹਨ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 576,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "खिमकै ॥",
