      "gurmukhi": "ਕਿ ਮਚੈਤ ਸੂਰੰ ॥",
      "transliteration": "k machait soora(n) ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਕਿਤੇ ਸੂਰਮੇ (ਕ੍ਰੋਧ ਨਾਲ) ਮਚੇ ਹੋਏ ਹਨ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 576,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "कि मचैत सूरं ॥",
