      "transliteration": "k uThait aga(n) ||257||",
      "translation": "The warriors are getting excited, the heavenly damsels are roaming and the sparks of fire coming out of the colliding swords.257.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਅਤੇ ਉਨ੍ਰਹਾ ਵਿਚ) ਅੱਗ (ਦੀਆਂ ਚਿਣਗਾ) ਨਿਕਲਦੀਆਂ ਹਨ ॥੨੫੭॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 576,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "कि उठैत अगं ॥२५७॥",
      "sourceLineId": "99054",
      "sourceShabadId": "9229",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0576_line_0045",
      "lineIndex": 45,
      "gurmukhi": "ਕਿ ਫੁਟੇਤਿ ਅੰਗੰ ॥",
      "transliteration": "k fuTet a(n)ga(n) ||",
