      "transliteration": "k gajet gaajee ||258||",
      "translation": "The limbs are being splitted, all are absorbed in the war, the horses are dancing and the warriors are thundering.258.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਲੜਾਕੇ ਸੂਰਮੇ ਗਜ ਰਹੇ ਹਨ ॥੨੫੮॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 576,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "कि गजेति गाजी ॥२५८॥",
